have to be shipped from Earth \u2013 at great cost.<br></li><li><strong>Randomized Research</strong> \u2013 The research projects available to you are randomized, and their feasibility, time, and cost may vary from one playthrough to another.  You also won\u2019t always know the time or cost of these projects at their outset \u2013 you\u2019ll have to balance the risk involved versus the potential reward.<br></li><li><strong>Disasters and Design Defects </strong>\u2013 Your colony may face serious accidents.  But even worse, your colony\u2019s systems may have randomly-determined design defects that are unknown at the start of the game and whose effects may last.  Each playthrough will bring different challenges.<br></li><li><strong>Altitude Matters</strong> \u2013 Should you float higher to get more solar energy, or float lower to be able to carry more weight?  It\u2019s up to you.<br></li><li><strong>Space Logistics</strong> \u2013 You can order new equipment and goods from Earth, but these things can only be shipped during realistic transfer windows, and can take over a hundred Earth days to arrive.  You\u2019ll need to plan your shipments carefully to avoid shortages.</li></ul><br>Wishlist and follow now!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196190/extras/9a8ccf0d4ea64b54a55e1a65366fce72.poster.avif?t=1705946719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196190/extras/9a8ccf0d4ea64b54a55e1a65366fce72.webm?t=1705946719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196190/extras/9a8ccf0d4ea64b54a55e1a65366fce72.mp4?t=1705946719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
